    "description": "National Archives and Records Administration - ARC 38936, LI 208-UN-29A - THE WAR ENDS IN EUROPE - DVD Copied by J. Williams.  Series: Motion Picture Films from \"United News\" Newsreels, compiled 1942 - 1945.  Crowds in Times Square celebrate news of V-E Day and people pray in churches. Pres. Truman announces the German surrender. U.S. and Russian troops meet at the Elbe. Shows Gen. Emil Reinhardt. Shows scenes of Nazi headquarters in Nuremberg.",
